      "title": "Navascues and Vertesi construct CHSH activation by tensoring",
      "text": "Navascues and Vertesi construct two two-qubit states whose arbitrary tensor powers each admit local hidden-variable models but whose product violates CHSH, reaching about 2.023, and also a single CHSH-local state whose two copies violate CHSH. Both constructions use no filtering, only direct measurements on the joint state, giving the explicit affirmative answer that the archived statement requests.",
